  - key: frank/3/mankey
    label: Greatsword
    direction: 'Frank Greatsword: retain a full-blade opening and the 1.40 s preparation
      from a rear three-quarter angle. Begin the deeper reveal through the 2.20 s
      sweep, then turn gradually toward the action depth as the receiver rises at
      3.70 s. The first rendered pass made both actors tiny after the 4.40 s knockback;
      the revised 135-145 degree finishing angle places that separation into depth
      while preserving the same side of the action axis. This is the standard Frank
      pair, not an execution take.'
