  - key: vol10/15/mankey
    label: Windmill throw
    direction: 'Windmill throw: the initial 0.74 s lifting capture obscured the attacker
      behind the rotating receiver. Replace the low view with a gradual 25-38 degree
      crane that reveals the grip before the 1.06 s receiver apex and the 1.15 s
      rotational burst. Retain the full arm-and-leg reach through the reaction at
      1.73 s, then ease down to an elevated forward-flank ground composition without
      spinning with the throw.'
